<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 30.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 30.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on December 27.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1   Prime Credit Tr     10.21	0.96</p>
<p>2   Villa World	   10.00	1.10</p>
<p>3   Schroder Intl	  9.82	2.45</p>
<p>4   Prop Income Inv	9.50	1.07</p>
<p>5   Indu Property	  9.48	0.96</p>
<p>6   BT Prop Trust	  9.38	1.74</p>
<p>7   Colonial Mutual	9.37	1.11</p>
